{
  "name": "Planning Workflow",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Assumptions (JAW-9930)\n- Sub-workflow from Intake with `requestId` and `qaResult`; test payload may also send `details` (rules payload uses `details` when present, else `qaResult`).\n- Base URL: `$env.BACKEND_BASE_URL`.\n- **Validate / rules / QA:** POST `/v1/planning/validate-request` with `{ requestId, details, qaResult }`.\n- **Notify:** POST `/v1/planning/ready-notify` after successful validation.\n- **Audit:** invalid/duplicate → POST `/v1/planning/event-record`.\n- **Failures:** POST `/v1/planning/team-alert`; run ends with Stop and Error.\n- Duplicate `requestId`: global static data in **Check Duplicate requestId** (same semantics as Remove Duplicates on `requestId`).\n- `settings.callerPolicy`: `workflowsFromSameOwner` (Intake caller).",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
      "name": "Assumptions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -200,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "inputSource": "workflowInputs",
        "workflowInputs": {
          "values": [
            {
              "name": "requestId"
            },
            {
              "name": "qaResult"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "b2c3d4e5-f6a7-8901-bcde-f12345678901",
      "name": "Ready Request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "inv-req-id",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.requestId }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "empty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "inv-missing-body",
              "leftValue": "={{ ($json.qaResult ?? '').trim() === '' && ($json.details ?? '').trim() === '' }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "or"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c3d4e5f6-a7b8-9012-cdef-123456789012",
      "name": "Invalid Request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        480,
        300
      ]
    },
